## 🔐 Security Groups & Purpose

| Group Name             | Purpose                                                    |
|------------------------|------------------------------------------------------------|
| `hr-staff`             | Allows login to HR workstations                            |
| `it-admins`            | Admin access and control across systems                    |
| `finance-staff`        | Allows login to Finance workstations                       |
| `sales-staff`          | Allows login to Sales workstations                         |
| `vpn-users`            | Used for VPN access control via GPO or future firewall     |
| `remote-desktop-users` | Enables remote login for designated IT personnel           |

---

## 🖥️ Workstation Naming Convention

Each department workstation is named using:

| Department | Workstation Name |
|------------|------------------|
| HR         | HR-PC01          |
| IT         | IT-PC01          |
| Finance    | FIN-PC01         |
| Sales      | SALES-PC01       |

All computers are joined to the domain `lab.local` and are located in their respective OU under `Workstations`.

---

## ✅ Summary

This structure was designed to simulate a real-world small to mid-sized enterprise environment with separation of duties, role-based access, and centralized policy enforcement via Active Directory and Group Policy.

